WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Welcome to the AI Confidence Academy.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:07.480
Thank you for joining us. We hear the
words “artificial intelligence” more and

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:12.400
more. But what is AI, and what does it
actually do? Artificial intelligence

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.880
is a broad name for computer systems
designed to perform tasks such as

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.720
recognizing patterns, interpreting
language, making predictions,

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.700
and generating content.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:28.000
Different AI systems do different things.
Some help identify unwanted email.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.140
Others recognize speech or recommend
information you might find useful.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:37.220
The kind you may encounter through tools
such as ChatGPT is called generative AI.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.600
It can create responses in words, images,
and other forms, drawing

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.400
on patterns learned during training and
the information available in your

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.320
conversation. That can make the experience
feel remarkably conversational. But a

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:55.820
fluent response is not proof that the
system has the facts right. So, how can

00:00:55.820 --> 00:01:00.320
this technology serve you? Imagine
receiving instructions for a project you

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:04.580
want to complete. The explanation is
lengthy, and several terms are unfamiliar.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:09.220
You could ask AI, “Explain these
instructions in everyday language.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.980
Then help me organize the steps.”

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:16.020
You might follow that with, “What do I
need before I begin?”

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:19.320
Or, “Explain step three with an example.”

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:23.800
Now you have something easier to work
with. You can compare it with the original

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.920
instructions, correct anything missing,

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:27.620
and decide how to proceed.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.780
That is one practical benefit:

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.260
helping make information more approachable
so you can participate with greater

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:39.220
understanding. Similar assistance can
support writing, planning, learning,

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:44.420
and developing ideas. It may help someone
express a thought, explore a

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:48.480
business concept, or find a manageable
starting point for a difficult task.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:53.120
But useful assistance still needs
thoughtful attention. AI can produce

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.820
incorrect information, overlook a
perspective,

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.880
or offer an answer that does not fit your
circumstances.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:01.760
And realistic images, voices,

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.340
and videos can be generated.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:09.300
Something that looks or sounds authentic
still deserves verification when it

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:12.100
matters. Keep private information
protected.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:17.560
Check important claims against reliable
sources. Be cautious about promises of

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.700
guaranteed results or effortless success.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.860
AI has many uses, and its benefits are not
automatic.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:27.980
How systems are designed—and how people
choose to use them—matters.

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:33.540
Responsible use begins with a clear
purpose, consideration for other people,

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.180
and a willingness to examine the result.

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:39.060
At ACA, we say: AI assists.

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:43.640
Humans verify. You do not have to
understand every technical detail to

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.320
begin. Learn the fundamentals.

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:49.920
Bring your questions. Practice with
something useful to you. People come

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.060
first. AI is the tool.

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:54.040
Confidence is the product.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:59.040
Thank you for spending this time with us.
We invite you to continue exploring the

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:01.520
Academy, and we look forward to learning
with you.

